  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed single-storey rear extension, by reason of its excessive size, siting, depth, and height, would result in an overbearing and unneighbourly form of development that would harm the residential amenity of the adjoining occupiers at Nos. 154 and 158 New River Crescent. The proposal would lead to a loss of outlook, increased sense of enclosure, and reduced access to light contrary to Policy CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010) and Policies DMD8, DMD11, and DMD37 of the Development Management Document (2014).",
